  <!-- ==================== FAQ SECTION ==================== -->
  <section class="faq-section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-grid">
        <!-- Col 1 -->
        <div class="faq-column">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Will my dumpster have a door that swings open?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Yes. Every roll-off container delivered by Dumpsters Now features heavy-duty rear walk-in doors that swing open wide. This allows you to walk heavy furniture, drywall sheets, and bulky debris directly into the dumpster without lifting items over high side walls.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Does the dumpster have a cover or lid?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Roll-off containers are open-top by design for efficient loading. If your dumpster sits outside during rain or snow, covering it with a tarp is a smart way to keep water out and prevent neighborhood trash dumping.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>How is the weight of my debris determined?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Weight is measured accurately at certified Michigan disposal facilities. The delivery truck weighs in upon arrival and weighs out after emptying. The net difference represents your exact debris weight. All facility scales are regulated by the State Bureau of Weights and Measures.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>What type of trash may incur extra costs?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Large and bulky electronic waste items, mattresses, tires, and items containing freon may incur a per-item fee at the disposal facility. Contact us for specific item details.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Col 2 -->
        <div class="faq-column">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>What materials are prohibited?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                To comply with Michigan DEQ and landfill safety regulations, we cannot accept hazardous materials. Prohibited items include wet paint, motor oil, gasoline, propane cylinders, asbestos, car batteries, biohazardous waste, and industrial solvents.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>What does the price include?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Our flat-rate pricing is 100% transparent and all-inclusive. Your quoted price covers initial drop-off delivery, final pickup haul-away, a generous tonnage weight allowance, driveway protection, and a standard 7-day rental period.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>How many tons can I put in my roll off dumpster?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                This depends on the size of the dumpster you rent. The Department of Transportation regulations limit the weight of any roll off dumpster to approximately 15 tons.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <button class="faq-question">
              <span>Will I be billed for extra weight?</span>
              <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M16.609 22.389c-0.37 0.37-0.97 0.37-1.34 0l-9.659-9.659c-0.37-0.37-0.37-0.97 0-1.34l0.447-0.447c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l8.542 8.542 8.542-8.542c0.37-0.37 0.97-0.37 1.34 0l0.447 0.447c0.37 0.37 0.37 0.97 0 1.34l-9.659 9.659z"/></svg>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <div class="faq-answer-content">
                Yes. If the weight of the materials in your dumpster exceeds the included weight quoted in your order confirmation, you will be charged for the additional weight.
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

